# Hamster Hub — Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** November 10, 2026
**Developer:** AxiomaraGames
**Contact:** axiomaragames@gmail.com

Hamster Hub ("the app") is a hamster care guide and companion: species profiles, care guides, a food checker, a symptom checker, a quiz and tips, and a profile, weight log and care reminders for your own hamsters. This policy explains what information the app handles, and the licences of the software it is built with.

## Summary

The app does not collect, transmit, sell or share any personal data. Everything you add to it stays on your device.

## Information the app stores on your device

To work, the app saves the following, **only on your device**:

- **My Hamsters:** the hamsters you add, with the name, species, sex, birthday and photo you give them, and their weight log
- **Care reminders:** your reminders, when they are due and when you last did them
- **Favorites, checklist and quiz:** the species you save, the checklist items you tick and your best quiz scores
- **Settings:** your notification settings and whether you have seen the welcome screen

This information is never sent to us or to anyone else. It is deleted when you uninstall the app or clear its data in your device's settings.

**Photos:** when you give a hamster a photo, you choose one from your device. The app keeps a copy in its own storage on your device. It is never uploaded.

**Notifications:** if you allow them, the app shows one daily notification listing the care reminders that are due. It is created on your device; no notification server is involved.

## Purchases

The app is free to download. The full version is a one-time in-app purchase made through Google Play. Google Play handles the payment under Google's own terms and privacy policy; we never see your payment details. The app only asks Google Play whether the full version has been bought on your Google account, so it can unlock it, also after a reinstall or on a new device.

## What the app does not do

- It does not ask you to create an account or sign in.
- It does not connect to our servers or any other server, apart from Google Play for the purchase described above. All profiles, guides and photos are built into the app.
- It does not collect analytics, crash reports, location, contacts or device identifiers.
- It does not show ads and contains no advertising or tracking software.
- It does not use your camera or microphone.

## Children

The app is a general reference about hamster care and is not directed at children. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children, because we collect no information at all.

## Changes to this policy

If this policy changes, the new version will be published at this address with a new effective date. Because the app collects no data, any change will not affect information you have already given us.

